The test "The second word of a 16-byte area is two more halves" (test_thread_local_byvalue.cpp) asserts exactly this text, but it only compares text and never assembles it.

The thread-local map is fd 8, and the fd is written in octal (PTX ISA 4.5.1: an octal literal is 0{octal digit}+):
